1495	## Anti-Patterns
1496	
1497	This profile is misapplied when:
1498	
1499	1. Executive, Worker, or Reviewer is treated as a persona without a declared
1500	   evaluation and authority relation;
1501	2. the frames are treated as an organizational hierarchy;
1502	3. Executive is made a universal context, semantic interpreter, or
1503	   implementation controller;
1504	4. Worker sends a candidate directly into an implied Reviewer activation;
1505	5. an activation refusal is relabeled as a Worker result or any Worker result
1506	   variant is selected without its required Reference Frame Method result;
1507	6. refused, incomplete, or re-entry work results have no route to Executive;
1508	7. Worker accepts its own result, infers continuation, or treats its role label
1509	   or broad workspace access as mutation authority;
1510	8. Reviewer relies on Worker narrative instead of acquiring the material live
1511	   subject;
1512	9. Reviewer trusts tests without reviewing their semantics where they can
1513	   change the proof;
1514	10. Reviewer edits or directs repair while retaining independent-review status;
1515	11. changed candidate or basis reuses the predecessor verdict;
1516	12. results from different coordinates are flattened into one relation;
1517	13. a local axioms file is treated as authority without an owning
1518	    Goals/Product/requirement/design decision;
1519	14. this profile restates `STDO-UP-020`, `STDO-UP-007`, or `STDO-UP-022` as
1520	    peer constitutional law;
1521	15. a project-defined configuration silently changes selected STDO law;
1522	16. consumer-specific realization machinery or a renamed architectural
1523	    equivalent is presented as a universal requirement;
1524	17. test labels or runner choice substitute for declaring the exact testing
1525	    frame, subject, claim, population, oracle, path, and falsification condition;
1526	18. unit-test, assertion, snapshot, line, branch, or function count is used as a
1527	    Product-confidence or closure measure;
1528	19. implementation-shaped unit tests are treated as independent design,
1529	    architecture, integration, installed, or user-outcome assurance;
1530	20. interface, persistence, orchestration, authority, configuration, or user
1531	    complexity is mocked away and then counted as unit-test coverage;
1532	21. helper-level tests become the canonical proof surface for a module-owned
1533	    algebra or for a broader Product composition;
1534	22. an expected output is accepted without proving the required authoritative
1535	    path or while a material rival path remains reachable;
1536	23. one end-to-end sunny path substitutes for a declared combinatorial
1537	    population, interaction-strength justification, failure coverage, and
1538	    residual set;
1539	24. UAT gains capabilities, information, setup paths, or interfaces unavailable
1540	    to the declared user;
1541	25. a harness, fixture, proof script, or expected-value builder reconstructs
1542	    owner-issued runtime meaning and treats that reconstruction as the assurance
1543	    subject;
1544	26. a downstream symptom is assigned to one owner when the evidence establishes
1545	    a joint causal frontier, unresolved alternatives, or no bounded frontier, or
1546	    localization is used to authorize wider repair;
1547	27. a mutation, sabotage, fixture, or proof capture changes the exact assurance
1548	    subject without isolation, restoration, and revalidation;
1549	28. aggregate green status hides a missing or conflicting user-acceptance,
1550	    end-to-end, integration, unit, or negative-path frame result;
1551	29. a generic specialist-frame family is treated as a required component,
1552	    actor, service, file, runtime type, stage, or new semantic owner; or
1553	30. a material generic family is omitted because no artifact shares its name,
1554	    or several families are flattened into one broad frame without preserving
1555	    their distinct evaluation and result relations;
1556	31. Reviewer assigns priority, decides promotion blocking, directs repair, or
1557	    starts another activation; or
1558	32. Executive collapses severity, priority, frame result, promotion-boundary
1559	    effect, and disposition into one status value.
1560	
1561	---
