1563	## Closure
1564	
1565	A project has applied this baseline to one outcome when:
1566	
1567	1. existing project authority admits and projects the exact frame basis;
1568	2. the complete selected STDO and Reference Frame Method remain the governing
1569	   sources;
1570	3. Executive, Worker, and Reviewer are finite evaluation frames, not hierarchy
1571	   or actor identities;
1572	4. activation refusal remains distinct from Worker results, and every Worker
1573	   result maps exclusively from one closed Reference Frame Method result and
1574	   returns first to Executive;
1575	5. Executive alone determines whether an exact candidate enters a Reviewer
1576	   activation under the applicable existing authority;
1577	6. required Reviewer assessment binds the exact subject, evidence population,
1578	   verdict, evidence-bound technical triage, and independence conditions;
1579	7. Executive consumes closed results and technical triage against the complete
1580	   Product view and current MVP or release mandate, keeps severity, priority,
1581	   frame result, and boundary effect distinct, and applies only the existing
1582	   `STDO-UP-020` disposition and continuation relation;
1583	8. specialist frames and result relations cover every known material
1584	   evaluation and interaction or retain an explicit residual;
1585	9. frame, basis, capability, evidence, and topology change can invalidate and
1586	   rechart the configuration;
1587	10. every material operation carries its existing owner's exact grant;
1588	11. no new execution authority, local constitutional layer, actor topology,
1589	    runtime, or universal completeness claim is inferred from the profile;
1590	12. every material Product testing claim is assigned to an exact
1591	    user-acceptance, end-to-end, integration, unit, or explicitly declared
1592	    alternative frame rather than inferred from a suite label;
1593	13. a user-outcome claim binds the declared user capability, exact Product
1594	    subject, supported ordinary surface, environment, and observable outcome;
1595	14. an end-to-end claim binds the exact deployed, installed, or otherwise
1596	    runnable Product form and records the required authoritative causal path
1597	    rather than accepting output equality through an unknown or forbidden path;
1598	15. material interface and Product factors have a declared combinatorial
1599	    population, adequate interaction strength, exercised scenario matrix, and
1600	    explicit residual combinations;
1601	16. unit-test evidence proves module-owned laws, including public module
1602	    contracts, and its volume and strategy are proportional to useful
1603	    discrimination of the module-bounded population rather than implementation
1604	    size;
1605	17. required paths have positive runnable-Product witnesses; the production
1606	    closure excludes obsolete, rival, fallback, and bypass paths; and the
1607	    assurance/source closure cannot falsely supply evidence or reintroduce a
1608	    removed production path, while declared isolated test-only seams remain
1609	    outside ordinary-path claims;
1610	18. source or code coverage, test count, and aggregate green status do not
1611	    substitute for Product, installed, path, composition, or user-frame proof;
1612	19. test fixtures, mutations, sabotage, proof capture, and assurance tooling
1613	    preserve or revalidate the exact subject they claim to evaluate;
1614	20. owner-issued Product and runtime truth is acquired through the exact owner
1615	    surface and evaluated by a separately derived oracle without a rival
1616	    assurance-owned semantic interpreter;
1617	21. counterexamples return a causally minimal supported frontier represented as
1618	    one unique locus, a jointly established incomparable set, unresolved
1619	    alternative frontiers, or `indeterminate` evidence;
1620	22. every Product, Product Composition, Design, Design Component, Public
1621	    Boundary, Entity, Operator, Owner, Effect, Reuse/Foundation, Install, and
1622	    Proof family material to the outcome has an exact declaration or
1623	    acquisition path, while every non-material or uncovered family has an
1624	    authority-bound disposition;
1625	23. every material cross-frame seam preserves or lawfully translates identity,
1626	    coordinate and basis, carried value or evidence, lifecycle scope,
1627	    authority, and provenance; and
1628	24. no consumer-specific architecture, renamed local topology, runtime object,
1629	    or component roster is inferred from the generic specialist set.
1630	
1631	A project-defined frame configuration closes against
1632	`REFERENCE_FRAME_METHOD.md`, the selected complete STDO cut, and its cited
1633	existing project authorities. It need not claim conformance to this optional
1634	baseline profile.
